Copyright (c) 2026 coder2423 and contributors

This project was developed with reference to Scott Prahl's miepython,
https://github.com/scottprahl/miepython, and its algorithm documentation.
The pinned numerical fixture tests/fixtures/miepython_reference.json was
generated with miepython 3.3.0 at commit
f4101f71aa6fbbf8a8e835b45778cee1b5cb637b.

The upstream copyright and MIT permission notice are preserved in
third_party/miepython_LICENSE.txt. The upstream source repository is not
bundled. Regenerating fixtures requires a separate checkout of that commit.

The Mie and Fraunhofer theories are established physical methods. Their
literature sources are acknowledged in README.md. No papers, textbook
chapters, thesis manuscripts, or upstream images are included in this
distribution. Example plots are generated by this MATLAB implementation.

AI tools assisted with development, documentation and review. Numerical
tests and physical consistency checks define the validation scope; they
do not constitute experimental validation.
